 "stimulus_html": "You are about to draw a card at random from a deck containing only these 10 cards: <span data-math=\"{\\text{A}} ♡\">{\\text{A}} ♡</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{A}} ♠\">{\\text{A}} ♠</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{A}} ♣\">{\\text{A}} ♣</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{A}}\\diamondsuit\">{\\text{A}}\\diamondsuit</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{K}}♠\">{\\text{K}}♠</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{K}}♣\">{\\text{K}}♣</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{Q}}♡\">{\\text{Q}}♡</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{Q}}♠\">{\\text{Q}}♠</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{J}}♡\">{\\text{J}}♡</span>, <span data-math=\"{\\text{J}}♠\">{\\text{J}}♠</span>. Compute the following probabilities:",
 "questions": [
